      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld-day streak"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "連續 %lld 天 · 本週 %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld-day streak · %@ this week"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "選一個收藏的節目或訂閱的 Podcast。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick a favorited show or a podcast you subscribe to."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "選一個節目，顯示並播放它最新的單集。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick a show to see and play its newest episode."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "選擇節目": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose Show"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "還沒有可以播放的單集": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing to play yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "還沒有可以播放的單集\n先下載或收藏一集吧": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing to play yet\nDownload or favorite an episode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "顯示正在播放的單集，並直接播放接下來的內容。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shows what’s playing and starts whatever comes next."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "點選節目旁的愛心\n就會出現在這裡": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap a show’s heart\nand it appears here"
          }
        }
      }
